Give transient nodes explicit scene-tree lifetimes.

Attach the default deck builder to its dungeon and the deferred-destruction
limbo node to Main so they are freed with their scenes.  Queue removed HUD
command buttons for deletion.  Keep existing deferred node destruction and
gameplay behavior unchanged.

Free each temporary dynamic-highlight node after packing its scene data.
The scene tile source retains the PackedScene, not the template node; the
TileMapLayer still owns and frees the separately instantiated visible tiles.

